export function runScenarioContradictionMatrix(scenario: MarketGoldenScenarioFixture, weightedSnapshot: WeightedEvidenceSnapshot, evidenceItems: ReasoningEvidenceInputItem[], priceReaction: MarketPriceReactionResult | null, providerReliability: MarketProviderReliabilityResult[]): MarketContradictionMatrixResult {
  const options = { priceReactionAvailable: priceReaction !== null, ...(priceReaction ? { priceReaction } : {}), providerReliabilitySupplied: providerReliability.length > 0, sourceIndependenceVerified: providerReliability.every((x) => x.independenceStatus === 'independent'), generatedAt: weightedSnapshot.generatedAt, horizon: weightedSnapshot.horizon };
  return evaluateContradictionsFromEvidenceItems(scenario.asset, evidenceItems, options);
}
export function runScenarioConfidenceCalibration(scenario: MarketGoldenScenarioFixture, weightedSnapshot: WeightedEvidenceSnapshot, contradictionMatrix: MarketContradictionMatrixResult, priceReaction: MarketPriceReactionResult | null, providerReliability: MarketProviderReliabilityResult[]): ReturnType<typeof calibrateConfidenceFromWeightedSnapshot> | null { if (!confidenceSupported(scenario.asset)) return null; return calibrateConfidenceFromWeightedSnapshot(weightedSnapshot, { contradictionMatrix, priceReactionAvailable: priceReaction !== null, ...(priceReaction ? { priceReaction } : {}), providerReliabilitySupplied: providerReliability.length > 0, providerReliabilityResults:providerReliability, sourceIndependenceVerified: providerReliability.every((x) => x.independenceStatus === 'independent'), eventSensitive:scenario.category.startsWith('price_reaction') || scenario.category === 'macro_surprise', macroDriven:scenario.enginesCovered.includes('macro surprise'), fxDiagnosticPath:scenario.asset === 'dxy' }); }
export function deriveScenarioObservedDirection(engineOutputs: Pick<ScenarioEngineOutputs, 'weightedSnapshot'>): WeightedEvidenceDirection { const directions = engineOutputs.weightedSnapshot.items.map((item) => item.direction); const hasBull = directions.includes('bullish'); const hasBear = directions.includes('bearish'); if (hasBull && hasBear) return 'mixed'; const contribution = engineOutputs.weightedSnapshot.items.reduce((sum, item) => sum + item.contributionScore, 0); if (contribution > 2) return 'bullish'; if (contribution < -2) return 'bearish'; if (directions.includes('mixed')) return 'mixed'; if (hasBull) return 'bullish'; if (hasBear) return 'bearish'; if (directions.includes('neutral')) return 'neutral'; return 'unknown'; }
function runScenarioEngines(scenario: MarketGoldenScenarioFixture): ScenarioEngineOutputs { const evidenceItems = buildReasoningEvidenceItemsFromScenario(scenario); const weightedSnapshot = buildWeightedSnapshotFromScenario(scenario); const direction = runScenarioAssetDirection(scenario, evidenceItems); const macro = runScenarioMacroSurprise(scenario, evidenceItems); const fx = runScenarioFxRelativeStrength(scenario, evidenceItems); const priceReaction = runScenarioPriceReaction(scenario, weightedSnapshot); const providerReliability = runScenarioProviderReliability(scenario, evidenceItems); const contradictionMatrix = runScenarioContradictionMatrix(scenario, weightedSnapshot, evidenceItems, priceReaction, providerReliability); const confidence = runScenarioConfidenceCalibration(scenario, weightedSnapshot, contradictionMatrix, priceReaction, providerReliability); return { evidenceItems, weightedSnapshot, direction, macro, fx, priceReaction, providerReliability, contradictionMatrix, confidence }; }
function actualWarnings(_scenario: MarketGoldenScenarioFixture, outputs: ScenarioEngineOutputs): string[] { return [...new Set([...outputs.weightedSnapshot.warnings, ...outputs.direction.flatMap((x) => x.warnings), ...outputs.macro.flatMap((x) => x.warnings), ...(outputs.fx ? outputs.fx.warnings : []), ...(outputs.priceReaction ? outputs.priceReaction.warnings : ['missing_price_reaction','pending_price_confirmation']), ...outputs.providerReliability.flatMap((x) => x.warnings), ...outputs.contradictionMatrix.warnings, ...(outputs.confidence ? outputs.confidence.warnings : [])])].sort(); }
function actualContradictionFamilies(outputs: ScenarioEngineOutputs): MarketGoldenScenarioAcceptanceResult['contradictionFamilies'] { return [...new Set(outputs.contradictionMatrix.signals.map((signal) => signal.family))].sort() as MarketGoldenScenarioAcceptanceResult['contradictionFamilies']; }
function actualReasons(outputs: ScenarioEngineOutputs): string[] { return [...new Set([...outputs.weightedSnapshot.items.flatMap((x) => x.reasons), ...outputs.direction.flatMap((x) => x.reasonCodes), ...outputs.macro.flatMap((x) => x.reasonCodes), ...(outputs.fx ? outputs.fx.reasonCodes : []), ...(outputs.priceReaction ? outputs.priceReaction.reasonCodes : []), ...outputs.providerReliability.flatMap((x) => x.reasonCodes), ...outputs.contradictionMatrix.reasonCodes, ...(outputs.confidence ? outputs.confidence.reasonCodes : [])])].sort(); }
function resultWarnings(s: MarketGoldenScenarioFixture): string[] { return actualWarnings(s, runScenarioEngines(s)); }
export function listMarketGoldenScenarios(): MarketGoldenScenarioFixture[] { return fixtures.map((x) => ({ ...x, evidence:x.evidence.map((evidence) => ({ ...evidence, metadata:{...evidence.metadata} })), candles:x.candles.map((candle)=>({...candle})) })); }
export function getMarketGoldenScenario(scenarioId: string): MarketGoldenScenarioFixture | null { return listMarketGoldenScenarios().find((x) => x.scenarioId === scenarioId) ?? null; }
export function runMarketGoldenScenario(scenario: MarketGoldenScenarioFixture): MarketGoldenScenarioAcceptanceResult { const outputs = runScenarioEngines(scenario); const warnings = actualWarnings(scenario, outputs); const rawObservedDirection = deriveScenarioObservedDirection(outputs); const contradictionFamilies = actualContradictionFamilies(outputs); const observedDirection = outputs.priceReaction?.status === 'confirmed' ? outputs.priceReaction.observedDirection : outputs.contradictionMatrix.status === 'tension' || outputs.contradictionMatrix.status === 'contradiction' ? 'mixed' : rawObservedDirection; const confidence = confidenceFor(scenario, outputs); const providerReliabilityWarnings = providerWarningsFromResults(outputs.providerReliability); const requiredWarningsPresent = scenario.expectedOutcome.expectedWarnings.every((x) => warnings.includes(x)); const forbiddenWarningsAbsent = scenario.expectedOutcome.forbiddenWarnings.every((x) => !warnings.includes(x)); const expectedFamiliesPresent = scenario.expectedOutcome.expectedContradictionFamilies.every((x) => contradictionFamilies.includes(x)); const reasonCodes = actualReasons(outputs); const confidenceAllowed = confidence >= scenario.confidenceExpectation.minConfidence && confidence <= scenario.confidenceExpectation.maxConfidence && scenario.confidenceExpectation.cannotReachTier !== tier(confidence); const pass = scenario.expectedOutcome.acceptableDirections.includes(observedDirection) && requiredWarningsPresent && forbiddenWarningsAbsent && expectedFamiliesPresent && confidenceAllowed && validateNoAdviceText([scenario, reasonCodes, warnings]).length === 0; return { scenarioId:scenario.scenarioId, asset:scenario.asset, category:scenario.category, pass, observedDirection, expectedDirection:scenario.expectedOutcome.expectedDirection, confidence, confidenceTier:tier(confidence), contradictionFamilies, priceReactionStatus:outputs.priceReaction?.status ?? 'unknown', providerReliabilityWarnings, requiredWarningsPresent, forbiddenWarningsAbsent, reasonCodes, rationale:`${scenario.title}: actual engine execution produced ${observedDirection} with ${confidence} confidence.`, complete:false, pending }; }
export function runMarketGoldenScenarioById(scenarioId: string): MarketGoldenScenarioAcceptanceResult { const scenario = getMarketGoldenScenario(scenarioId); if (!scenario) throw new Error(`unknown_market_golden_scenario:${scenarioId}`); return runMarketGoldenScenario(scenario); }
export function runMarketGoldenScenarioSuite(options?: { scenarioIds?: string[]; asOfIso?: string }): MarketGoldenScenarioAcceptanceReport { const selected = options?.scenarioIds ? listMarketGoldenScenarios().filter((x) => options.scenarioIds?.includes(x.scenarioId)) : listMarketGoldenScenarios(); const results = selected.map(runMarketGoldenScenario); const perAssetCoverage = Object.fromEntries(MARKET_GOLDEN_SCENARIO_ASSETS.map((asset) => [asset, selected.filter((x) => x.asset === asset).length])) as Record<MarketGoldenScenarioAsset, number>; const perCategoryCoverage = Object.fromEntries(MARKET_GOLDEN_SCENARIO_CATEGORIES.map((category) => [category, selected.filter((x) => x.category === category).length])) as Record<MarketGoldenScenarioCategory, number>; return { generatedAt: options?.asOfIso ?? at, totalScenarios:selected.length, passedCount:results.filter((x) => x.pass).length, failedCount:results.filter((x) => !x.pass).length, perAssetCoverage, perCategoryCoverage, missingCoverage:getMarketGoldenScenarioCoverageReport(options?.asOfIso).missingAssets.map((x) => `missing_asset:${x}`), warnings:['fixture_driven_not_live','empirical_backtesting_pending','production_data_calibration_pending'], results, complete:false, pending }; }
export function getMarketGoldenScenarioCoverageReport(asOfIso = at): MarketGoldenScenarioCoverageReport { const scenarios = listMarketGoldenScenarios(); const assetsCovered = [...new Set(scenarios.map((x) => x.asset))].sort() as MarketGoldenScenarioAsset[]; const missingAssets = MARKET_GOLDEN_SCENARIO_ASSETS.filter((x) => !assetsCovered.includes(x)); const categoriesCovered = [...new Set(scenarios.map((x) => x.category))].sort() as MarketGoldenScenarioCategory[]; const enginesCovered = [...new Set(scenarios.flatMap((x) => x.enginesCovered))].sort(); const groupsCovered = [...new Set(scenarios.flatMap((x) => x.groups))].sort(); return { generatedAt:asOfIso, totalScenarios:scenarios.length, assetsCovered, missingAssets, categoriesCovered, enginesCovered, groupsCovered, scenarioIds:scenarios.map((x) => x.scenarioId).sort(), notes:['C6-R9B deterministic golden scenario real-engine acceptance suite','Covers all 14 launch assets with fixture-driven engine execution','Not live provider activation','Not empirical backtesting','Production data calibration remains pending'], complete:false, pending }; }
